{"seq":1,"slug":"category-lifecycle-rationalization","title":"品类/单品生命周期与汰换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/category-assortment-range-planning/assortment-lifecycle-kpi/category-lifecycle-rationalization","wordCount":2070,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"品类-单品生命周期与汰换\">品类/单品生命周期与汰换</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>品类不是静态结构。它的需求会随季节、技术替代、消费习惯与竞争格局变化，它的内部构成也会不断分化：曾经的主力款变成长尾，偶然的爆款变成新主力，一批边缘款悄悄沉到零动销。<strong>生命周期管理</strong>要做的不是事后处理这些变化，而是把它们变成可预期的阶段迁移，并在每个阶段给出不同的资源姿态。</p>\n<p>产品生命周期的经典模型给出四个阶段：导入期销量低且&quot;几乎不赚钱&quot;；成长期&quot;销量显著上升&quot;且&quot;盈利能力开始上升&quot;；成熟期&quot;销量见顶并达到市场饱和&quot;；衰退期销量下滑、&quot;价格与盈利能力一同走低&quot;（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Product_life-cycle_management_(marketing)\">Product life-cycle management (marketing)，Wikipedia</a>）。</p>\n<p>这套模型被广泛使用，但它的判据是出名的含糊：识别产品处于哪个阶段&quot;更像是一门艺术而不是科学&quot;，而在阶段交替期尤其&quot;非常困难&quot;。批评者甚至质疑这个概念本身的价值（同一条目引用了 Dhalla 与 Yuspeh 的《Forget the product life cycle concept》）。对工程实践的意义是：<strong>生命周期阶段不能靠主观判断，必须由可计算的代理指标推断，且推断结果要允许错。</strong></p>\n<p>另一条被这套模型忽视的约束来自长尾本身的规模。把商品按热度排成一条曲线，头部是少数只卖大销量的爆款，尾部是数量庞大、每款只卖几件的冷门品；尾部这些&quot;非热门商品&quot;的总销量就是所谓的长尾，其主张是&quot;低需求或低销量的商品可以共同形成一个市场份额&quot;，前提是渠道足够宽（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Long_tail\">Long tail，Wikipedia</a>）。跨境线上渠道恰好满足这个前提——库位成本远低于实体货架，因此长尾的绝对规模比实体零售大得多。</p>\n<p>这带来一个与本篇主线相反的警示：<strong>长尾的总量可能很大，但单款的价值可能极低</strong>。同一条目引用的研究发现，目录渠道的商品销售分布相当符合 80/20 规律，而互联网渠道需要修正为 72/28；同时也指出批评者认为数字渠道同样会强化爆款，且一项音乐研究发现分布呈对数正态而非幂律，大量上架曲目一件都没卖出去。对汰换决策的含义是：不能因为&quot;长尾总量可观&quot;就整体豁免长尾，也不能因为&quot;单款价值低&quot;就整体清除——必须按单品粒度判断，而这正是本篇的判据要解决的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阶段推断的可计算判据\">阶段推断的可计算判据</h2><h3 id=\"单品层-从销量轨迹到阶段\">单品层：从销量轨迹到阶段</h3><p>单品阶段由三个可计算量共同刻画：<strong>趋势方向</strong>（近 N 期销量的一阶趋势）、<strong>波动水平</strong>（销量序列的变异系数）、以及<strong>量级相对峰值</strong>（当前销量相对该 SKU 历史峰值的比例）。这三个量构成一个足够区分四阶段的特征向量。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH weekly AS (&#10;  SELECT sku_id, date_trunc(&#39;week&#39;, order_date) AS wk, SUM(units) AS units&#10;  FROM sales_fact&#10;  WHERE order_date &gt;= CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL &#39;26 weeks&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY sku_id, wk&#10;), feat AS (&#10;  SELECT sku_id,&#10;         regr_slope(units, EXTRACT(EPOCH FROM wk))     AS slope,&#10;         AVG(units)                                    AS mean_units,&#10;         STDDEV_SAMP(units) / NULLIF(AVG(units), 0)    AS cv,&#10;         MAX(units)                                    AS peak_units,&#10;         (ARRAY_AGG(units ORDER BY wk DESC))[1]&#10;           / NULLIF(MAX(units), 0)                     AS last_over_peak,&#10;         COUNT(*)                                      AS weeks_observed&#10;  FROM weekly&#10;  GROUP BY sku_id&#10;)&#10;SELECT sku_id,&#10;       CASE&#10;         WHEN weeks_observed &lt; 6                       THEN &#39;new&#39;&#10;         WHEN mean_units &lt; $1 AND last_over_peak &gt;= 0.8 THEN &#39;introduction&#39;&#10;         WHEN slope &gt; 0 AND last_over_peak &gt;= 0.6      THEN &#39;growth&#39;&#10;         WHEN ABS(slope) &lt; $2 AND cv &lt; $3              THEN &#39;maturity&#39;&#10;         ELSE &#39;decline&#39;&#10;       END AS lifecycle_stage,&#10;       slope, cv, last_over_peak&#10;FROM feat;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> weekly </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id, date_trunc(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'week'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, order_date) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wk, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(units) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> units</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sales_fact</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'26 weeks'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id, wk</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), feat </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         regr_slope(units, EXTRACT(EPOCH </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wk))     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slope,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(units)                                    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mean_units,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         STDDEV_SAMP(units) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(units), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         MAX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(units)                                    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> peak_units,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         (ARRAY_AGG(units </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wk </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))[1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">MAX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(units), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> last_over_peak,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> weeks_observed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> weekly</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> weeks_observed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 6</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                       THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'new'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mean_units </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> last_over_peak </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'introduction'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slope </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> last_over_peak </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'growth'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ABS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(slope) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">              THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'maturity'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'decline'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lifecycle_stage,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       slope, cv, last_over_peak</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> feat;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>阈值的选取依赖品类销量量级，因此三个阈值都做参数化（<code>$1</code> 微小量级线、<code>$2</code> 斜率平稳带、<code>$3</code> 变异系数上限），并由品类历史回测标定。</p>\n<h3 id=\"品类层-从-sku-分布到结构健康\">品类层：从 SKU 分布到结构健康</h3><p>品类层不能简单聚合单品的阶段，因为品类可能同时包含大量成长期与衰退期 SKU 而看起来&quot;总量平稳&quot;。真正的品类信号是<strong>结构分布的形状</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>品类的衰退期 SKU 占比</th>\n<th>成长期 SKU 占比</th>\n<th>结构判读</th>\n<th>应采取的姿态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>低（&lt;15%）</td>\n<td>高（&gt;25%）</td>\n<td>扩张中</td>\n<td>增加宽度，OTB 倾斜</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>稳定成熟</td>\n<td>维持结构，优化深度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高（&gt;35%）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>结构老化</td>\n<td>启动汰换，补充候选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>剧烈换代</td>\n<td>谨慎，区分真换代与噪声</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>右下角是最危险也最容易被误读的状态：老产品在死、新产品在起，总量可能持平甚至上升，掩盖了结构在快速换血这件事。此时若不加干预，一旦新产品未能接棒，品类会断崖式下跌。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[品类 SKU 阶段分布] --&gt; B{衰退占比 vs 成长占比}&#10;  B --&gt;|衰退低 成长高| C[扩张姿态&lt;br/&gt;增宽 + OTB 倾斜]&#10;  B --&gt;|衰退低 成长低| D[维持姿态&lt;br/&gt;优化深度]&#10;  B --&gt;|衰退高 成长低| E[汰换姿态&lt;br/&gt;补候选 + 清结构]&#10;  B --&gt;|衰退高 成长高| F[换代姿态&lt;br/&gt;谨慎验证接力能力]&#10;  C --&gt; G[下一周期复评]&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  E --&gt; H[末位淘汰评审]&#10;  F --&gt; G\">graph TD\n  A[品类 SKU 阶段分布] --&gt; B{衰退占比 vs 成长占比}\n  B --&gt;|衰退低 成长高| C[扩张姿态&lt;br/&gt;增宽 + OTB 倾斜]\n  B --&gt;|衰退低 成长低| D[维持姿态&lt;br/&gt;优化深度]\n  B --&gt;|衰退高 成长低| E[汰换姿态&lt;br/&gt;补候选 + 清结构]\n  B --&gt;|衰退高 成长高| F[换代姿态&lt;br/&gt;谨慎验证接力能力]\n  C --&gt; G[下一周期复评]\n  D --&gt; G\n  E --&gt; H[末位淘汰评审]\n  F --&gt; G</pre><h2 id=\"汰换的结构化流程\">汰换的结构化流程</h2><h3 id=\"汰换不是删-sku-是换结构\">汰换不是删 SKU，是换结构</h3><p>最容易被做错的汰换是&quot;把零动销 SKU 下架&quot;，因为零动销往往只是结果，原因可能是曝光不足、价格不对位、或商品页信息缺失。直接下架会同时删掉&quot;真实需求未被满足&quot;的证据。</p>\n<p>结构化的汰换按三步走，每步的判据不同：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def rationalize_sku(sku, thresholds):&#10;    &quot;&quot;&quot;返回 (action, reason)。先归因，再决定去留。&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;    if sku.units_90d == 0:&#10;        if sku.impressions_90d &lt; thresholds[&quot;min_impressions&quot;]:&#10;            return &quot;boost_exposure&quot;, &quot;no_traffic&quot;          # 不是商品问题&#10;        if not sku.has_core_attributes:&#10;            return &quot;fix_content&quot;, &quot;missing_attributes&quot;     # 不是商品问题&#10;        if sku.price_band_coverage &gt; 1:&#10;            return &quot;delist&quot;, &quot;redundant_in_band&quot;           # 同格有更好替代&#10;        return &quot;delist&quot;, &quot;no_demand&quot;&#10;    if sku.contribution_margin_90d &lt;= 0:&#10;        return &quot;reprice_or_delist&quot;, &quot;negative_contribution&quot;&#10;    if sku.weeks_of_supply &gt; thresholds[&quot;max_wos&quot;]:&#10;        return &quot;markdown_then_review&quot;, &quot;slow_moving&quot;&#10;    return &quot;keep&quot;, &quot;healthy&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rationalize_sku</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sku, thresholds):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"\"\"返回 (action, reason)。先归因，再决定去留。\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku.units_90d </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku.impressions_90d </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> thresholds[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"min_impressions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"boost_exposure\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"no_traffic\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          # 不是商品问题</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku.has_core_attributes:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"fix_content\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"missing_attributes\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">     # 不是商品问题</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku.price_band_coverage </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"delist\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"redundant_in_band\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           # 同格有更好替代</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"delist\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"no_demand\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku.contribution_margin_90d </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"reprice_or_delist\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"negative_contribution\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku.weeks_of_supply </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> thresholds[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"max_wos\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"markdown_then_review\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"slow_moving\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"keep\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"healthy\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>no_traffic</code> 与 <code>missing_attributes</code> 两类都不该判死——它们分别属于曝光运营与商品信息运营，把它们计入汰换会使汰换名单失真，且会周期性地重复相同的错误。</p>\n<h3 id=\"动销率的双重用途\">动销率的双重用途</h3><p>动销率（有销量 SKU 数 / 在架 SKU 数）既是诊断指标也是汰换的输入，但它有一个著名的可操纵性：<strong>只要下架零动销 SKU，动销率立刻上升</strong>,而真实经营没有变好。因此动销率必须与贡献毛利额一起看：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>动销率上升 + 贡献毛利额上升 → 真实的汰换成功；</li>\n<li>动销率上升 + 贡献毛利额下降 → 下架砍掉了有贡献的长尾，结构被过度收紧；</li>\n<li>动销率下降 + 贡献毛利额上升 → 新增 SKU 尚未起量，属于扩张期的正常状态。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这个三方判读是 <a href=\"category-sellthrough-profit-kpi\">动销率/贡献毛利/品类健康 KPI</a> 的核心，本节的汰换流程必须把这两个指标一起输出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"汰换节奏与批次化\">汰换节奏与批次化</h2><h3 id=\"为什么必须批次化\">为什么必须批次化</h3><p>逐个 SKU 零散汰换有两个问题：一是每次下架都要重算价格带覆盖与矩阵缺口，计算与评审成本高；二是零散下架会让品类结构持续小幅震荡，用户侧感知为&quot;这个店的东西总在变&quot;。因此汰换应当<strong>批次化</strong>，每季度或每半年一批。</p>\n<p>批次化的代价是响应变慢，因此需要区分两类例外，允许即时下架：<strong>合规类</strong>（证书失效、被监管下架）与<strong>质量类</strong>（退货率异常且归因为质量）。这两类不进批次，即时执行。</p>\n<h3 id=\"批次汰换的规模控制\">批次汰换的规模控制</h3><p>单批汰换的 SKU 数应有上限，否则会造成一次性结构断层。经验规则是单批下架不超过在架 SKU 数的 15%，且单批下架造成的贡献毛利额下降不超过品类贡献毛利的 5%。后一条约束通常比前一条更紧，因为次要长尾 SKU 数量多但毛利贡献小，而主力 SKU 数量少但一旦被误判影响巨大。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>约束</th>\n<th>上限</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>下架 SKU 数占比</td>\n<td>≤15% / 批</td>\n<td>防止一次性结构断层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>下架贡献毛利额占比</td>\n<td>≤5% / 批</td>\n<td>防止误删有贡献的长尾</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单批新增 SKU 数占比</td>\n<td>≤20% / 批</td>\n<td>防止结构剧烈换血</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单批价格带覆盖变化</td>\n<td>±1 个带</td>\n<td>防止价格带出现断层</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>生命周期阶段必须由可计算判据推断（销量趋势、变异系数、相对峰值），因为经典模型的阶段识别&quot;更像艺术而非科学&quot;。</li>\n<li>单品阶段与品类结构是两个层级的问题；品类层的真正信号是衰退期与成长期 SKU 的<strong>占比组合</strong>，而非总量。</li>\n<li>&quot;衰退高 / 成长高&quot;是最危险的状态：总量掩盖了快速换血，一旦接棒失败会断崖下跌。</li>\n<li>汰换必须先归因再决定去留；零动销可能是曝光不足或属性缺失造成，直接下架会删掉需求未被满足的证据。</li>\n<li>动销率可被下架操纵，必须与贡献毛利额联合判读，三方组合各有明确的含义。</li>\n<li>汰换应批次化（每季度或半年一批）并设规模上限；合规与质量两类例外允许即时下架。</li>\n<li>末位淘汰的具体排名规则与退市流程见 <a href=\"shelf-delist-lastplace-rule\">末位淘汰与退市</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"品类/单品生命周期与汰换","id":"品类-单品生命周期与汰换"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"阶段推断的可计算判据","id":"阶段推断的可计算判据"},{"level":3,"text":"单品层：从销量轨迹到阶段","id":"单品层-从销量轨迹到阶段"},{"level":3,"text":"品类层：从 SKU 分布到结构健康","id":"品类层-从-sku-分布到结构健康"},{"level":2,"text":"汰换的结构化流程","id":"汰换的结构化流程"},{"level":3,"text":"汰换不是删 SKU，是换结构","id":"汰换不是删-sku-是换结构"},{"level":3,"text":"动销率的双重用途","id":"动销率的双重用途"},{"level":2,"text":"汰换节奏与批次化","id":"汰换节奏与批次化"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么必须批次化","id":"为什么必须批次化"},{"level":3,"text":"批次汰换的规模控制","id":"批次汰换的规模控制"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"OTB 与采购/预测协同","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/category-assortment-range-planning/open-to-buy-budget/otb-procurement-forecast-link"},"next":{"title":"末位淘汰与退市","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/category-assortment-range-planning/assortment-lifecycle-kpi/shelf-delist-lastplace-rule"}}